<title>JAPAN: Japan Telecom down on selling ahead of year end.</title>
<headline>Japan Telecom down on selling ahead of year end.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Telecom Co Ltd was the largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo bourse on Monday afternoon as selling ahead of the year-end weighed heavily on the issue, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0519 GMT, the shares were down 170,000 yen at 1.93 million yen.</p>
